Med Biol</source><year>1991</year><volume>36</volume><fpage>1423</fpage><lpage>1432</lpage><!--PubMed citation query: 'Phys Med Biol||36|1423||bib7|'--></citation></ref><ref id="bib8"><citation citation-type="book"><person-group person-group-type="author"><collab>Food and Drug Administration</collab></person-group><article-title/><source>Revised 510(k) Diagnostic Ultrasound Guidance for 1993</source><year>1993</year><publisher-name>Rockville, MD: Center for Devices and Radiological Health</publisher-name></citation></ref><ref id="bib9"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Henderson</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name><name><surname>Willson</surname><given-names>K</given-names></name><name><surname>Jago</surname><given-names>JR</given-names></name><name><surname>Whittingham</surname><given-names>TA</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>A survey of the acoustic outputs of diagnostic ultrasound equipment in current clinical use</article-title><source>Ultrasound Med Biol</source><year>1995</year><volume>21</volume><fpage>699</fpage><lpage>705</lpage><!--PubMed citation query: 'Ultrasound Med Biol||21|699||bib9|'--><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">8525560</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="bib10"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Hjalmars</surname><given-names>U</given-names></name><name><surname>Kulldorff</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Wahlqvist</surname><given-names>Y</given-names></name><name><surname>Lannering</surname><given-names>B</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Increased incidence rates but no space&#x02013;time clustering of childhood astrocytoma in Sweden, 1973&#x02013;1992: a population-based study of pediatric brain tumors</article-title><source>Cancer</source><year>1999</year><volume>85</volume><fpage>2077</fpage><lpage>2090</lpage><!--PubMed citation query: 'Cancer||85|2077||bib10|'--><pub-id